# =============================================================================
# COST OPTIMIZATION CHECKLIST
# =============================================================================
# 1. Put multimodal/vision models only in [stages.vision].
# 2. Prefer text_model or stage.model for translation and QA.
# 3. Set fallback_model to a cheaper reliable remote model.
# 4. Set local_model for offline recovery or bulk low-priority runs.
# 5. Use CLI --provider for temporary provider swaps; stage.model still wins.